v 3
d validemail. Email validation via Regex, DNS/MX Check, and Disposable Domain Detection
d Eric A. Booth, eric.a.booth@gmail.com
d
d validemail provides a multi-stage validation for email address variables. 
d It performs Regex format checks, Disposable email detection, 
d and DNS/MX record verification.
d
d Requires: Stata 16.0 or newer
d
d Author: Eric A. Booth, Sr Researcher, Texas 2036
d Support: eric.a.booth@gmail.com
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260730
d
